    <tag k="colour" v="black"/>
    <tag k="description" v="Created to ease maintenance on the &quot;main&quot; Thames Path from Source to Woolwich. The North (or true Left) Bank has many diversions away. Through central London (Battersea Bridge to Tower Bridge) the route tends to hug the River."/>
